{"title":"Career Roadmap · ESG Associate","role":"ESG Associate","summary":"An ESG (Environmental, Social and Governance) Associate helps organizations measure, analyze, report, and improve their environmental, social, and governance performance. The role sits at the intersection of sustainability, corporate reporting, risk, compliance, data analysis, and business strategy.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc. (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Sustainability / Environmental Studies"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a Sustainability / Environmental Studies graduate, this is a strong corporate pathway because the degree provides environmental knowledge while the student can add ESG reporting, sustainability standards, data analytics, finance, and corporate governance."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical route:"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Sc. Sustainability/Environmental Studies → Sustainability/ESG Internship → ESG Associate → Senior ESG Associate/Analyst → ESG Manager → Sustainability/ESG Lead → Head of Sustainability / ESG Director"},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"ESG is a broad corporate field rather than one single regulated profession. Exact responsibilities vary between consulting firms, companies, investors, ratings providers, and reporting teams."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons: 2026–2046","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2028"},{"text":"Student / ESG Intern"},{"text":"Sustainability + ESG fundamentals"}],[{"text":"2028–2030"},{"text":"ESG Associate / Sustainability Analyst"},{"text":"Data collection + reporting"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"ESG Analyst / Senior Associate"},{"text":"ESG metrics + disclosures + analysis"}],[{"text":"2033–2037"},{"text":"ESG Manager / Sustainability Manager"},{"text":"Programs + reporting + stakeholder management"}],[{"text":"2037–2042"},{"text":"ESG Lead / Sustainability Lead"},{"text":"Corporate strategy + risk"}],[{"text":"2042–2046"},{"text":"Head of ESG / Sustainability Director"},{"text":"Enterprise-level sustainability strategy"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Key Skills","Proof"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Sustainability foundation"},{"text":"Environment, climate, sustainability concepts"},{"text":"Research project"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"ESG fundamentals"},{"text":"E/S/G frameworks, materiality, ESG metrics"},{"text":"ESG analysis project"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Reporting + analytics"},{"text":"Excel, Power BI, sustainability reporting"},{"text":"ESG dashboard"}],[{"text":"Year 4 (if applicable)"},{"text":"Corporate readiness"},{"text":"ESG reporting, risk, assurance, stakeholder management"},{"text":"Internship + ESG report"}],[{"text":"Post-graduation"},{"text":"Specialization"},{"text":"ESG reporting, climate risk, carbon, sustainable finance"},{"text":"Professional experience"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Sustainability Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong environmental knowledge first."},{"type":"h","text":"Environmental subjects"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Climate change"},{"text":"Environmental science"},{"text":"Ecology"},{"text":"Biodiversity"},{"text":"Natural resources"},{"text":"Water management"},{"text":"Waste management"},{"text":"Air pollution"},{"text":"Energy systems"},{"text":"Sustainable development"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Sustainability concepts"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sustainable development"},{"text":"Circular economy"},{"text":"Resource efficiency"},{"text":"Sustainable consumption"},{"text":"Renewable energy"},{"text":"Decarbonization"},{"text":"Climate adaptation"},{"text":"Environmental justice"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Also understand the UN Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) and how organizations connect sustainability initiatives to measurable outcomes."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Learn ESG"},{"type":"p","text":"ESG has three major pillars."},{"type":"h","text":"Environmental"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Greenhouse-gas emissions"},{"text":"Energy consumption"},{"text":"Renewable energy"},{"text":"Water"},{"text":"Waste"},{"text":"Biodiversity"},{"text":"Pollution"},{"text":"Resource efficiency"},{"text":"Climate risks"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Social"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Employee health and safety"},{"text":"Diversity and inclusion"},{"text":"Human rights"},{"text":"Labor practices"},{"text":"Community impact"},{"text":"Supply-chain labor practices"},{"text":"Customer/product responsibility"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Governance"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Board governance"},{"text":"Business ethics"},{"text":"Anti-corruption"},{"text":"Compliance"},{"text":"Risk management"},{"text":"Data governance"},{"text":"Whistleblower mechanisms"},{"text":"Executive accountability"}]}]},{"heading":"ESG Is More Than Environmental Sustainability","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A common mistake is treating ESG as another name for environmental management."},{"type":"p","text":"A good ESG professional understands:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Environment","Social","Governance","Business Risk","Data","Reporting"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"p","text":"A company's carbon emissions are environmental."},{"type":"p","text":"A workplace safety incident is social."},{"type":"p","text":"A corruption investigation is governance."},{"type":"p","text":"All three can affect:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial performance"},{"text":"Reputation"},{"text":"Regulatory exposure"},{"text":"Investor confidence"},{"text":"Business continuity"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — ESG Data and Reporting","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is where the graduate becomes employable."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn ESG data collection"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how companies collect:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Energy consumption"},{"text":"Fuel consumption"},{"text":"Electricity usage"},{"text":"GHG emissions"},{"text":"Water consumption"},{"text":"Waste generation"},{"text":"Employee statistics"},{"text":"Workplace accidents"},{"text":"Diversity data"},{"text":"Supplier information"},{"text":"Governance metrics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data tools"},{"type":"p","text":"Become strong in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL basics"},{"text":"Python basics"},{"text":"Data visualization"}]}]},{"heading":"Carbon Accounting","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Carbon accounting is one of the strongest technical skills for an ESG career."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Scope 1"},{"type":"p","text":"Direct emissions from sources owned or controlled by the organization."},{"type":"h","text":"Scope 2"},{"type":"p","text":"Indirect emissions associated with purchased electricity, heat, steam or cooling."},{"type":"h","text":"Scope 3"},{"type":"p","text":"Other indirect value-chain emissions."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Emission factors"},{"text":"Activity data"},{"text":"GHG calculations"},{"text":"Carbon footprinting"},{"text":"Data quality"},{"text":"Emissions boundaries"},{"text":"Supplier data"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A student should understand the GHG Protocol concepts thoroughly."}]},{"heading":"ESG Reporting Frameworks","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Become familiar with major frameworks and standards."},{"type":"h","text":"Important areas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GRI"},{"text":"IFRS Sustainability Disclosure Standards — ISSB/IFRS S1 and S2"},{"text":"SASB legacy standards/concepts"},{"text":"TCFD concepts"},{"text":"TNFD"},{"text":"CDP"},{"text":"GHG Protocol"},{"text":"UN SDGs"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Frameworks and regulatory requirements continue to evolve, so students should learn to verify the currently applicable requirements for the country, industry, and reporting year rather than treating any one framework as universally mandatory."}]},{"heading":"India-Specific ESG Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For an India-focused career, learn about:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SEBI sustainability disclosure requirements"},{"text":"BRSR"},{"text":"BRSR Core concepts"},{"text":"ESG assurance"},{"text":"Corporate sustainability reporting"},{"text":"Indian environmental regulations"},{"text":"Companies Act-related governance concepts"},{"text":"Climate-related disclosure developments"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact applicability and reporting requirements can change, so current SEBI requirements should be checked when preparing an actual corporate report."}]},{"heading":"ESG Specialisations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Core Skills","Possible Career"],"rows":[[{"text":"ESG Reporting"},{"text":"Disclosures, frameworks, data"},{"text":"ESG Reporting Analyst"}],[{"text":"Carbon Accounting"},{"text":"GHG Protocol, emissions"},{"text":"Carbon Analyst"}],[{"text":"Climate Risk"},{"text":"Climate scenarios, risk"},{"text":"Climate Risk Analyst"}],[{"text":"Sustainability"},{"text":"Sustainability programs"},{"text":"Sustainability Analyst"}],[{"text":"ESG Data"},{"text":"Excel, BI, data quality"},{"text":"ESG Data Analyst"}],[{"text":"ESG Assurance"},{"text":"Controls, evidence, verification"},{"text":"ESG Assurance Associate"}],[{"text":"Supply-Chain ESG"},{"text":"Supplier assessments"},{"text":"Sustainable Supply Chain Analyst"}],[{"text":"Social Sustainability"},{"text":"Human rights, workforce"},{"text":"Social Impact Analyst"}],[{"text":"Governance"},{"text":"Risk, compliance, ethics"},{"text":"ESG Governance Analyst"}],[{"text":"Sustainable Finance"},{"text":"Finance + ESG"},{"text":"ESG Investment Analyst"}],[{"text":"Biodiversity"},{"text":"Nature-related impacts"},{"text":"Nature/ESG Analyst"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target organizations such as:"},{"type":"h","text":"Consulting"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sustainability consulting"},{"text":"ESG consulting"},{"text":"Climate advisory"},{"text":"Risk consulting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Corporates"},{"type":"p","text":"Look for sustainability teams in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"IT"},{"text":"Banking"},{"text":"Energy"},{"text":"FMCG"},{"text":"Automotive"},{"text":"Pharmaceuticals"},{"text":"Infrastructure"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Financial institutions"},{"type":"p","text":"Explore:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ESG investing"},{"text":"Sustainable finance"},{"text":"Climate risk"},{"text":"Responsible investment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"NGOs and research organizations"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sustainability research"},{"text":"Climate policy"},{"text":"Environmental programs"},{"text":"Social-impact projects"}]}]},{"heading":"Internship Titles to Search","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Search for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ESG Intern"},{"text":"Sustainability Intern"},{"text":"ESG Research Intern"},{"text":"ESG Data Intern"},{"text":"Sustainability Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Climate Risk Intern"},{"text":"Carbon Accounting Intern"},{"text":"ESG Reporting Intern"},{"text":"Sustainability Consulting Intern"},{"text":"Environmental Analyst Intern"}]}]},{"heading":"Strong Internship Project","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"note","label":"Project","text":"Corporate ESG Assessment"},{"type":"p","text":"Select a publicly listed company and conduct an academic ESG assessment using its publicly available disclosures."},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze:"},{"type":"h","text":"Environmental"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GHG emissions"},{"text":"Energy"},{"text":"Renewable-energy usage"},{"text":"Water"},{"text":"Waste"},{"text":"Environmental targets"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Social"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Workforce"},{"text":"Diversity"},{"text":"Employee safety"},{"text":"Training"},{"text":"Community programs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Governance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Board structure"},{"text":"Ethics"},{"text":"Risk management"},{"text":"Anti-corruption"},{"text":"Governance policies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Then create:"},{"type":"flow","items":["ESG dataset","KPI analysis","Power BI dashboard","materiality analysis","ESG scorecard","recommendations"]},{"type":"p","text":"Clearly label your scoring methodology as your own analytical framework rather than an official rating."}]},{"heading":"Build an ESG Portfolio","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, create:"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1"},{"type":"h","text":"Corporate ESG assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2"},{"type":"h","text":"Carbon footprint calculation"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3"},{"type":"h","text":"ESG Power BI dashboard"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4"},{"type":"h","text":"Climate-risk analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5"},{"type":"h","text":"Sustainable supply-chain assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6"},{"type":"h","text":"ESG reporting gap analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"This provides much stronger evidence of ability than completing only generic sustainability courses."}]},{"heading":"Certifications and Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Prioritize knowledge in:"},{"type":"h","text":"ESG"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ESG fundamentals"},{"text":"ESG reporting"},{"text":"Sustainability strategy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Carbon"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GHG accounting"},{"text":"Carbon footprinting"},{"text":"Scope 1/2/3"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Reporting"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GRI"},{"text":"ISSB/IFRS Sustainability"},{"text":"BRSR"},{"text":"CDP"},{"text":"TCFD/TNFD concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Finance"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial statements"},{"text":"Corporate finance basics"},{"text":"Risk"},{"text":"Investment fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not collect certificates without developing practical ESG-analysis capability."}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential entry-level roles include:"},{"type":"h","text":"ESG"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ESG Associate"},{"text":"ESG Analyst"},{"text":"ESG Research Analyst"},{"text":"ESG Reporting Associate"},{"text":"ESG Data Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Sustainability"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sustainability Analyst"},{"text":"Sustainability Associate"},{"text":"Sustainability Executive"},{"text":"Corporate Sustainability Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Climate"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Climate Risk Analyst"},{"text":"Carbon Analyst"},{"text":"Climate Data Analyst"},{"text":"Decarbonization Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Consulting"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ESG Consulting Analyst"},{"text":"Sustainability Consulting Associate"},{"text":"Environmental Consulting Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Assurance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ESG Assurance Associate"},{"text":"Sustainability Assurance Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Finance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ESG Investment Research Analyst"},{"text":"Sustainable Finance Analyst"}]}]},{"heading":"Employer Interview Questions","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"ESG fundamentals"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What is ESG?"},{"text":"How is ESG different from sustainability?"},{"text":"Explain the three ESG pillars."},{"text":"What is materiality?"},{"text":"What is double materiality?"},{"text":"What are Scope 1, 2 and 3 emissions?"},{"text":"What is carbon neutrality?"},{"text":"What is net zero?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Reporting"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What is GRI?"},{"text":"What are IFRS S1 and S2?"},{"text":"What is BRSR?"},{"text":"Why is ESG data assurance important?"},{"text":"How would you verify ESG data?"},{"text":"What is a sustainability disclosure?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Why does ESG matter to investors?"},{"text":"How can climate change create financial risk?"},{"text":"How would you assess a company's ESG performance?"},{"text":"How would you identify an ESG data gap?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical test"},{"type":"p","text":"You may be given:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Company data","calculate emissions","analyze ESG KPIs","create dashboard","identify gaps","write recommendations"]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Science/environment route"},{"type":"p","text":"Consider:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Sc. Environmental Science"},{"text":"M.Sc. Environmental Management"},{"text":"M.Sc. Sustainability"},{"text":"M.Sc. Climate Science"},{"text":"M.Sc. Environmental Economics"},{"text":"M.Sc. Geoinformatics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Management route"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc.","ESG/Sustainability Experience","MBA"]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful specializations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sustainability Management"},{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"Strategy"},{"text":"Business Analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialized route"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc.","ESG Experience","PG/Professional specialization in Sustainability or Climate Risk"]}]},{"heading":"ESG + Finance Route","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"One of the strongest career combinations is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Sustainability","ESG","Finance"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accounting"},{"text":"Financial statements"},{"text":"Corporate finance"},{"text":"Investment analysis"},{"text":"Risk"},{"text":"Portfolio concepts"},{"text":"Sustainable finance"},{"text":"ESG integration"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential roles:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ESG Investment Analyst"},{"text":"Sustainable Finance Analyst"},{"text":"ESG Research Analyst"},{"text":"Climate Risk Analyst"},{"text":"Responsible Investment Analyst"}]}]},{"heading":"ESG + Data Analytics Route","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Another high-value combination:"},{"type":"flow","items":["ESG","Data","BI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Data quality"},{"text":"Data governance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build an automated dashboard showing:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Energy","Emissions","Water","Waste","Workforce","Safety","Governance"]},{"type":"p","text":"This can lead to:"},{"type":"flow","items":["ESG Data Analyst","Senior ESG Data Analyst","ESG Data Lead"]}]},{"heading":"ESG + Climate Risk","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Physical climate risk"},{"text":"Transition risk"},{"text":"Climate scenarios"},{"text":"Carbon pricing"},{"text":"Decarbonization"},{"text":"Climate adaptation"},{"text":"Business continuity"},{"text":"Risk modelling"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential industries:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Banking"},{"text":"Insurance"},{"text":"Asset management"},{"text":"Energy"},{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"Consulting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Career path:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Climate Risk Analyst","Senior Analyst","Climate Risk Manager","ESG/Climate Risk Lead"]}]},{"heading":"ESG + Supply Chain","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Large organizations increasingly need ESG information from suppliers."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supplier assessments"},{"text":"Sustainable procurement"},{"text":"Human rights"},{"text":"Supplier audits"},{"text":"Scope 3 emissions"},{"text":"Responsible sourcing"},{"text":"Traceability"},{"text":"Circular supply chains"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential role:"},{"type":"h","text":"Sustainable Supply Chain Analyst"},{"type":"p","text":"Progression:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Analyst","Senior Analyst","Supply Chain Sustainability Manager","Sustainable Procurement/ESG Lead"]}]},{"heading":"Government / Policy Route","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Environmental policy"},{"text":"Climate policy"},{"text":"Sustainable development"},{"text":"Corporate reporting policy"},{"text":"Public-sector sustainability"},{"text":"Climate programs"},{"text":"Environmental regulation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible environments:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Government departments"},{"text":"Regulatory bodies"},{"text":"Public-sector organizations"},{"text":"Research institutions"},{"text":"Policy think tanks"},{"text":"Development organizations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For government positions, eligibility should always be checked against the specific recruitment notification."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential postgraduate fields:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sustainability Management"},{"text":"Environmental Management"},{"text":"Climate Change"},{"text":"Sustainable Development"},{"text":"ESG"},{"text":"Environmental Economics"},{"text":"Sustainable Finance"},{"text":"Climate Risk"},{"text":"Corporate Sustainability"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Countries worth researching:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"USA"},{"text":"Singapore"},{"text":"Switzerland"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For international ESG careers, prioritize programs that combine sustainability + business + data + finance rather than environmental theory alone."}]},{"heading":"ESG + AI","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI will increasingly be used for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ESG data extraction"},{"text":"Sustainability-report analysis"},{"text":"Emissions estimation"},{"text":"Supplier-risk monitoring"},{"text":"Climate-risk modelling"},{"text":"Document classification"},{"text":"ESG anomaly detection"},{"text":"Automated reporting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"NLP basics"},{"text":"Data analytics"},{"text":"AI-assisted document analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"But AI-generated ESG data must be traceable, auditable, and verified. ESG reporting cannot simply rely on unverified AI-generated claims."}]},{"heading":"2040–2046 Evolution","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"ESG roles are likely to move toward enterprise sustainability and risk management."},{"type":"h","text":"From reporting → strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"Companies will increasingly expect ESG professionals to explain:"},{"type":"flow","items":["ESG data","financial risk","business impact","strategic decision"]},{"type":"h","text":"Climate risk integration"},{"type":"p","text":"ESG teams may work closely with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Risk"},{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"Strategy"},{"text":"Procurement"},{"text":"Legal"},{"text":"Operations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Nature and biodiversity"},{"type":"p","text":"Expect increasing attention to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Biodiversity"},{"text":"Ecosystem dependencies"},{"text":"Water security"},{"text":"Deforestation"},{"text":"Nature-related risks"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Carbon management"},{"type":"p","text":"Professionals may work on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Decarbonization roadmaps"},{"text":"Carbon accounting"},{"text":"Transition planning"},{"text":"Renewable-energy strategies"},{"text":"Scope 3 reduction"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, aim for:"},{"type":"h","text":"Sustainability"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Climate change"},{"text":"Environmental management"},{"text":"Circular economy"},{"text":"Sustainable development"},{"text":"Resource efficiency"}]},{"type":"h","text":"ESG"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ESG fundamentals"},{"text":"Materiality"},{"text":"ESG metrics"},{"text":"ESG reporting"},{"text":"BRSR"},{"text":"GRI"},{"text":"ISSB"},{"text":"Climate/nature disclosure concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Carbon"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GHG Protocol"},{"text":"Scope 1/2/3"},{"text":"Carbon footprinting"},{"text":"Emission factors"},{"text":"Decarbonization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accounting basics"},{"text":"Financial statements"},{"text":"Risk management"},{"text":"Corporate governance"},{"text":"Business strategy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Data visualization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Report writing"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Stakeholder communication"},{"text":"Project management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Industry proof"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"1 ESG internship"},{"text":"1 corporate ESG assessment"},{"text":"1 carbon-footprint project"},{"text":"1 Power BI ESG dashboard"},{"text":"1 climate-risk project"},{"text":"1 ESG reporting gap analysis"},{"text":"Strong ESG portfolio"}]}]},{"heading":"Target Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Sustainability + environmental foundation","Year 2: ESG + climate + governance fundamentals","Year 3: ESG reporting + carbon accounting + data analytics","Year 4: ESG internship + corporate ESG projects","Graduate: ESG Associate / Sustainability Analyst","2–5 years: Senior ESG Analyst / ESG Consultant","5–10 years: ESG Manager / Sustainability Manager","10–20 years: ESG Lead / Head of Sustainability / ESG Director"],"label":"Year 1"},{"type":"h","text":"Best profile by graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Sc. Sustainability/Environmental Studies + ESG reporting + GHG accounting + BRSR/GRI/ISSB awareness + climate-risk fundamentals + corporate governance + Excel/Power BI/SQL + strong ESG portfolio + internship experience."},{"type":"p","text":"This combination opens pathways into corporate ESG, sustainability consulting, carbon accounting, climate risk, ESG data analytics, sustainable finance, ESG assurance, supply-chain sustainability, and corporate sustainability leadership."},{"type":"p","text":"929 | UG | Science | B.Sc (General / Honours) | Wildlife Biology / Ecology / Conservation | Wildlife Biologist (Junior)"}]}]}